From 6eeb6e016cb6c3769148f1c7d075b8496a624e9f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Varun-iiitb <var3907@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 17:58:35 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 59/60] Hindi liveness texts corrected by a native speaker, and
 the Hindi layout at 360 dp checked (task 27)

The Hindi review of 2026-10-28 (both batches): the reviewer's term for liveness replaces the machine
translation's, which means liveliness or vibrancy, not biometric liveness; plainer words for residents.
Every text is taken from the reviewer's files ("Your correction", or the quoted suggestion), not retyped.

- The 14 corrections (rows marked N): liveness_title_resident, status_starting, status_checking,
  status_passed, status_cancelled, guidance_no_face, error_liveness_not_verified, tips_capture_area,
  button_retry (now two words); model_title, model_installed, model_rolled_back, model_not_allowed,
  model_confirm_rollback.
- Three optional suggestions on rows marked Y, adopted (simpler words, same meaning):
  feedback_action_detected, guidance_improve_lighting, model_current (its {version} kept).
- Not adopted: the reviewer's "change Retry wording everywhere" note on
  error_verification_not_completed (a global change; the reviewer called the current wording standard).
- Consistency: no other Hindi text used the old term or the English loanword for "capture", so nothing more
  changed.
- The review notes of app_hi.arb record the review; Arabic and Kannada stay pending.

Tests:
- liveness_page_layout_test: Hindi at 360x640 for every state (23): no overflow, buttons on screen and 48
  high, every button label on one line, and the status at most 2 lines, counted in lines (a Noto Sans
  Devanagari line at 20 sp is 27 dp, Latin's 25, so the existing height bound is Latin's). The reviewed texts
  take 1 or 2 lines at 20 sp; none shrinks.
- liveness_page_locale_test (the Hindi title and Retry), liveness_l10n_test and model_bundle_test (the review
  note).
- flutter test test/liveness: 325 passing (302 + 23), 20 skipped. flutter analyze: the 2 known infos.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
